  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "A special election is expected to be held in Tennessee to fill Marsha Blackburn's unexpired Senate term.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384240998:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Democrats are defending five seats in states that voted for Donald Trump in 2024.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384240998:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Senators serve in three classes with staggered terms, so a different class is elected every other year.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384240998:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Across 35 Senate races this year, Democrats won 20, Republicans 13, and 2 have not yet been called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:the-senate-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:31Z",
      "text": "Democrats gained seats in Iowa, North Carolina, Kansas, Maine, Ohio, South Carolina and Texas.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ia",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-nc",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ks",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-me",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-oh-special",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-sc",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-tx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:39Z",
      "text": "For the 36 governor's races this year, 36 have not yet been called, with Democrats and Republicans each at 0.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-gubernatorial-elections:governors-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "In the House, Democrats hold 254 seats and Republicans 162, with 19 still to be called; 218 seats make a majority.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-infobox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:55Z",
      "text": "In the race tables, 53 districts changed party, and 20 are not yet called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, 111,686 people read the English article, about 49 times the usual daily level.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2028_United_States_Senate_elections:2026-11-05",
        "views:en:2028_United_States_Senate_elections:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:10Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 3 languages, and after English the most readers were in Turkish, with 18.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2028_United_States_Senate_elections:2026-11-05",
        "views:tr:2028_Amerika_Birleşik_Devletleri_Senatosu_seçimleri:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:17Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers; a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:tr:2028_Amerika_Birleşik_Devletleri_Senatosu_seçimleri:2026-11-05",
        "views:ko:2028년_미국_상원의원_선거:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:27Z",
